{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106340","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1110634001:0":{"text":"오우거의... 전투 방식이 내가 기억하고 있던 것과 좀 달라졌어.","source_cn":"奥格……他战斗的方式和我记忆中不同了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CB7DB32622F65FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1110634002:0":{"text":"음... 오우거가 아직 그때의 실패를 극복하지 못한 것 같아.","source_cn":"嗯……奥格他对当年的失败，并没有释怀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D7AFE2B765E0D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110634003:0":{"text":"오우거의 행동을 완전히 이해하진 못해도, 오우거는 여전히 존경스러운 상대야...","source_cn":"但他依然是一个可敬的对手，尽管我对他的行事并不能苟同……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0A7BC05137C2DB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"브루투스","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}